-<div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/sell/">Sell</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">For Sale By Owner</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Selling without an agent in South Carolina</p><h1 class="detail-h1">For sale by owner<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">in Myrtle Beach.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge, 30+ years on the Grand Strand &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated September 5, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Selling by owner is legal in South Carolina. Do it with a licensed coach, keep the savings if it works, and pay nothing extra if you hire an agent later.</p><div style="margin-top:1.8rem;display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="#lead-form">Ask about FSBO coaching</a><a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call 854.333.2135</a></div></div></div><section style="background:var(--navy)" id="lead-form"><div class="wrap" style="padding:3rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:.8rem">Sell it yourself, with a licensed team behind you.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);margin:0 auto 1.6rem;line-height:1.7">FSBO coaching for a flat fee: pricing, paperwork, and process. Hire us to list at any point and the full coaching fee is credited back.</p></div><div id="ldWrap" style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--ivory);border-radius:14px;padding:1.6rem;text-align:left"><div class="idx-lead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><input class="idx-input" id="ldCtx" placeholder="Property address"></div><div class="idx-lead"><input class="idx-input" id="ldName" placeholder="Your name"><input class="idx-input" id="ldPhone" placeholder="Phone" type="tel"></div><div class="idx-lead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><input class="idx-input" id="ldEmail" placeholder="Email" type="email"></div><label style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:flex-start;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 .85rem;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="ldConsent" style="margin-top:.15rem;accent-color:var(--brass);flex-shrink:0;width:15px;height:15px"><span>I consent to receive calls and text messages from Chapter 3 Realty about my property inquiry, showing appointments, and listing information I requested, at the phone number provided, including calls placed using an automated system or an artificial or prerecorded voice. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply HELP for help, STOP to opt out. Consent is not a condition of any purchase.</span></label><p id="ldErr" style="display:none;color:#a03333;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 .7rem"></p><button class="btn btn-brass" style="width:100%" onclick="ldSubmit()">Ask about FSBO coaching</button><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin:.7rem 0 0;line-height:1.5">Free, no obligation. We reach out the same day, evenings included. Prefer to talk now? <a href="tel:+18543332135" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding:.35rem .8rem;font-size:.8rem">Call 854.333.2135</a>.</p></div><div id="ldOk" style="display:none;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(244,239,232,.08);border:1px solid var(--brass);border-radius:14px;padding:1.4rem;color:var(--ivory);text-align:center;line-height:1.6">Thanks. A licensed team member will reach out the same day, evenings included, to explain the coaching and build your free pricing analysis.</div><script>
