+	(2) contains a computational error;<br /><br />
+	the seller may file an amended nonresident withholding statement with the department and request a refund for any amount over withheld or pay any amount due.<br /><br />
+	(G) The department shall prescribe rules and regulations necessary to enforce and administer the provisions of this section.<br /><br />
